00:20:25.000 --> 00:21:11.000
Thinking nothing of it, the woman placed the item of clothing inside an empty pop plant container with the intention of later throwing it away. Half an hour later, she was hit with a stark realization. Louise Bell had been wearing a floral yellow pajama top on the night she went missing. Police were notified of the discovery and presented the item to Colin and Diane Bell. The couple noticed the label from the inside collar of the top was missing, confirming that it belonged to their daughter. Diane herself recalled previously cutting the large red label from the garment after Louise had complained it was itching her neck.

